                <syllable xml:id="m-02b93fa9-b16c-4a61-ad8f-fa320935fddf">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-a2b9cba2-71bd-4ea3-8568-f231326f48bd" type="punctum" xml:id="m-ee645373-8929-44f6-ac60-85dc4845bb33">
                    <nc xml:id="m-767d2cc8-6ad7-4f0c-84c6-5337d33bf0fd" pname="a" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-336c0252-f0db-46f5-8f43-236954b51ea7">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-82a755f8-3405-454b-a23f-12130b3b4347" type="clivis" xml:id="m-605afa85-6d82-4fe6-9664-1dbde9d95448">
                    <nc xml:id="m-4ba597ca-0ac5-48af-9e28-c49ca4f2c015" pname="a" oct="3" />
                    <nc xml:id="m-5dc9f2f0-1f81-4267-b92c-2348512a09d3" pname="g" oct="3">
                      <signifLet xml:id="m-41e8c7c9-608d-42b7-808e-659df3beb762" />
                    </nc>
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <divLine xml:id="m-4bdd4cb4-65b6-4373-b5e5-77feabb9a487" facs="#m-db971431-16fd-41b3-8ee6-3e9c3c7dca87" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-5517ef4b-9ffa-45a2-bd3a-241a509a36a5">
              <lg xml:id="m-2a5fd2a9-e293-4da5-947e-e7f87f7c246a">
                <l xml:id="m-e5253d71-5a62-467e-9e3c-ba17c4ad67c9" facs="#m-f889205f-4b08-4a74-9ce4-84c2a044a4fb" label="text-like">The Common Tones of the Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-fb12446e-b430-4d5a-94d7-f33cdf07505c" facs="#m-4bce2d90-9eb5-4413-bd3d-739183f83bfb" label="ambiguous">109</l><l xml:id="m-7f94913f-4206-4d5e-8dbd-425b19cdd261" facs="#m-2056597e-7825-4435-8513-a079f0109f2b" label="text-like">Except for the full stop. mhich is modulated as has just been shown, the</l><l xml:id="m-1ff93895-2192-4427-8060-7b523614cc1e" facs="#m-6ba3142a-fd9b-45ee-b21c-07e69b9436de" label="text-like">formulas of this tone resemble those of the preceding tone, but the intervals</l><l xml:id="m-343a33d0-325d-433c-86b0-ca920dd36aa7" facs="#m-825182b8-a4b0-4664-a969-69327f641f01" label="text-like">are different. With monosyllables or Hebrew words, the full stop is as</l><l xml:id="m-9d61a3db-9997-419b-8a3d-fdfb9540d302" facs="#m-472546bb-a0b8-4259-9e90-9272532517b3" label="ambiguous">follows:</l><l xml:id="m-a2fe8b69-1574-4d86-b1af-48742c0a1b35" facs="#m-8d743f8f-fd35-484c-9f1a-d713afe3c93e" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-68197bb2-53ea-47bf-8cd7-fb500f790d8a" facs="#m-e967fe20-c0f4-4e4c-a049-009f017ca71b" label="ambiguous">B</l><l xml:id="m-ed57fd86-866b-4574-9a12-3831641f5629" facs="#m-8ca6314f-3c1f-4262-b656-57cc96afe305" label="lyrics-like">nésci¬</l><l xml:id="m-075ae477-c11a-49fe-baec-56f78e120e19" facs="#m-067f18ef-f4ce-48c4-8be2-0592b59324d4" label="lyrics-like">nésci¬</l><l xml:id="m-9ecc126d-3e97-4577-a46c-74988c9e8441" facs="#m-87f957d6-743f-42a5-85d3-a288739147b4" label="ambiguous">vos.</l><l xml:id="m-38ca8946-99cd-4a40-9bcc-bcf26526e118" facs="#m-02311f69-e5f6-44e8-9786-d95140aa4ff5" label="ambiguous">o</l><l xml:id="m-27bbaa23-3547-497f-beea-0ac6ebcc4e74" facs="#m-4830bbb0-2ebb-4728-86a4-2ea61eb39f11" label="ambiguous">o</l><l xml:id="m-aba9d8ca-c360-4664-bf6d-23a1420018f9" facs="#m-986ff9cf-83f1-4702-b6c7-383c6c3cbdc9" label="ambiguous">vos.</l><l xml:id="m-c3bbeca5-210f-4a80-a848-27edb445af83" facs="#m-f4a5af94-e168-4bca-afff-b630bd688161" label="ambiguous">quibus</l><l xml:id="m-fcad0f70-93f7-4220-9ef6-4c860da9f541" facs="#m-218a4a36-8101-4bd6-89f9-4f3dc2bfefa1" label="lyrics-like">dátum est.</l><l xml:id="m-79fae454-454f-4526-a3bb-69d728347d33" facs="#m-75147d21-4e37-44fb-a60a-b45f3f7747a6" label="lyrics-like">quibus dá-tum est.</l><l xml:id="m-1053f5a8-95fa-4185-a098-05dad323dcdb" facs="#m-dd688241-b9f6-4154-9808-47ffdaa739d8" label="text-like">or:</l><l xml:id="m-41898aa6-dc33-4a0f-ae76-dc7de0284318" facs="#m-3261b418-c3f5-40d8-a0c2-1c7c20c5cdac" label="ambiguous">tribus</l><l xml:id="m-2b3baa15-482b-40ab-9a66-df561beee1de" facs="#m-1f5a082e-d5fb-4556-ab32-8120c9594194" label="ambiguous">Is-ra¬ el.</l><l xml:id="m-ca8b700f-215b-48ba-9248-b517c4154bf6" facs="#m-3cc6e5a7-bfc4-47a3-8be4-c6565b6e9b5b" label="ambiguous">tribus Is- ra- el.</l><l xml:id="m-b76ee78e-47e0-410d-ac38-a82ee0e31070" facs="#m-4253744a-ef2d-473e-97c1-9291a0985e0e" label="lyrics-like">fú-it sic.</l><l xml:id="m-1fcae829-d860-4e1d-a300-66cb78e7247a" facs="#m-cc35e25d-4eec-446b-ad87-46c4d9b4c201" label="ambiguous">sic.</l><l xml:id="m-ed5aa3e1-90bd-4aba-a5c0-e063f43a41a9" facs="#m-0b8b0769-53c5-4feb-a3ad-62cf15a1cf3c" label="lyrics-like">L non fú¬ it</l><l xml:id="m-29679b1b-4b4d-474f-8825-ae58301fc649" facs="#m-8d1fa728-952e-4084-97e9-7fa10dffc47d" label="ambiguous">non</l><l xml:id="m-53eaa2de-af17-495f-9c44-1ec9aa377a42" facs="#m-4cf2eb09-b8c9-462a-adce-4191b07a2a59" label="text-like">Tone for the Prefaces.</l><l xml:id="m-82cfd3fe-0527-4da5-8ad1-8972078151d8" facs="#m-b6d2033c-f2d9-4408-b92b-0d02382e6f09" label="ambiguous">1. Solemn Tone.</l><l xml:id="m-9032197c-35d8-4c28-856d-ad8f241fd73d" facs="#m-35792d36-5566-4389-a7fa-3b5cf3e4e8b4" label="lyrics-like">ÉR ómni-a saécu-la saecu-ló-rum. R. Amen. Y. Dóminus vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-6c19b3ed-4930-44bf-912b-3635aa54f499" facs="#m-aeef2cfd-6ebd-49a5-8141-7af91477fd52" label="lyrics-like">bíscum. R. Et cum spí-ri-tu tú-o. V. Sursum córda. R. Habémus ad</l><l xml:id="m-f2469b45-937d-4ef4-b73d-24dc4be5c9c9" facs="#m-f8ebf7bd-a747-446f-a157-37834f4bd847" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum. V. Gráti-as agámus Dómino Dé-o nóstro. R. Dignum</l><l xml:id="m-2e226d1d-c7e9-42c6-8f3b-f92c5cc4421f" facs="#m-e90fe5b1-fd6a-48a6-9269-221f3d384735" label="lyrics-like">et jústum est.</l><l xml:id="m-15720c7d-9ade-4e47-a84f-f05a23d673cf" facs="#m-b729cfb6-e217-4eea-aaa8-f18de84b4cd8" label="ambiguous">2. Ferial Tone.</l><l xml:id="m-1e62c104-729c-4f77-8b0d-e6d52b4417e1" facs="#m-bceec5c1-c58f-4b5c-87fe-877423a19628" label="lyrics-like">LER ómni-a saécu-la saecu-ló-rum. K. Amen. Y. Dóminus vo¬</l><l xml:id="m-d611c9a7-2653-4a07-8b19-0ff9d34513e8" facs="#m-80410714-7fc4-46e5-977b-5a9efea82aeb" label="lyrics-like">bíscum. R. Et cum spí-ri-tu tú-o. V. Sursum córda. R. Habémus ad</l><l xml:id="m-02d3a5b6-8ab8-41f3-9b9c-511581d55d83" facs="#m-d553f7ca-dccb-4178-baea-49f7c83df003" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum. V. Grá-ti-as agámus Dómino Dé-o nóstro. R. Dígnum</l><l xml:id="m-d921aed0-9e3a-4a4e-939b-8c743b10addd" facs="#m-b875612f-ffb4-4730-8b3b-57cbb02af478" label="lyrics-like">et jústum est.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>